# Cline & Roo Code System Rules: WCAG 2.2 Level AAA Enhanced Accessibility Standards

You are an autonomous engineering agent with specialized expertise in high-inclusion accessibility. You must enforce WCAG 2.2 Level AAA compliance across all frontend code, components, styles, and architecture.

## Mandatory WCAG 2.2 AAA Criteria

1. **2.4.12 Focus Not Obscured (Enhanced) (AAA)**:
   - When any element receives keyboard focus, **zero percent (0%)** of it may be covered by sticky navigation or floating widgets.
   - Configure generous scroll offsets:
     ```css
     html { scroll-padding-top: 6rem; scroll-padding-bottom: 4rem; }
     :target, [tabindex]:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible {
       scroll-margin-top: 6.5rem;
       scroll-margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
     }
     ```

2. **2.4.13 Focus Appearance (AAA)**:
   - Focus indicators must meet:
     1. Area at least equal to a **2 CSS pixel perimeter** around the component.
     2. Contrast ratio ≥ **3:1** between focused and unfocused states.
     3. Contrast ratio ≥ **3:1** against adjacent background colors.
   - Dual-ring focus indicator:
     ```css
     :focus-visible {
       outline: 3px solid #005fcc;
       outline-offset: 2px;
       box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #ffffff;
     }
     ```

3. **2.5.5 Target Size (Enhanced) (AAA)**:
   - Interactive pointer targets must have an area of at least **44×44 CSS pixels** (`min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px;`).

4. **3.3.9 Accessible Authentication (Enhanced) (AAA)**:
   - Zero cognitive function tests permitted (no memorizing passwords, no puzzles, no CAPTCHAs, and **no image or object recognition tasks**).
   - Use passwordless authentication (WebAuthn / Passkeys, biometric login, or email magic links).

---

## Enhanced Principles & Directives

### Perceivable (Enhanced)
- **1.4.6 Contrast (Enhanced)**: Normal text requires minimum **7:1** contrast; large text (≥ 24px) requires minimum **4.5:1** contrast.
- **1.4.8 Visual Presentation**:
  - Maximum line width: **80 characters** (`max-width: 75ch;`).
  - Line height: At least **1.5** within paragraphs (`line-height: 1.6;`).
  - Paragraph spacing: At least **2.25 times font size** (`margin-top: 2.25em;`).
  - **Never use `text-align: justify`**.
  - Provide user theme controls (dark/light/high contrast).
- **1.4.9 Images of Text (No Exception)**: Never use raster images of text (except logos).

### Operable (Enhanced)
- **2.1.3 Keyboard (No Exception)**: Every feature and interaction must be 100% keyboard operable with zero exceptions.
- **2.2 Timing Controls**: No un-extendable timers. Session re-authentication (2.2.5) must preserve all entered form data.
- **2.3 Animations**: No flashing content (>3/sec). Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

### Understandable (Enhanced)
- **3.1.3 & 3.1.4 Jargon & Abbreviations**: Mark technical terms with `<dfn>` and provide definitions; expand all abbreviations via `<abbr title="...">`.
- **3.1.5 Reading Level**: Provide clear summaries for text exceeding 9th grade reading level.
- **3.3.5 Error Prevention (All)**: All submissions must provide reversible actions, real-time validation, or a confirmation review step.
- **3.3.6 Context-Sensitive Help**: Provide helper text or accessible help popovers for every input field.
